  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 contains breaking changes. See \"Upgrading from 1.x\" in the README.\n- Targets .NET 10 (previously .NET 8)\n- Templates are passed as trailing params arguments instead of through Filters.Templates\n- Filters.Type, ChallengeRating, and Alignment are now the lists Types, ChallengeRatings, and Alignments, matching any value in each list\n- AbilityRandomizer.Roll is set through the constructor\n- ICreatureVerifier.VerifyCompatibility takes the ability randomizer and templates\n- Fixed alignment generation when chaining multiple templates or filtering by alignment\n- Template minimum ability scores (Ghost, Half-Celestial, Half-Fiend) are honored for the given ability randomizer, and rolled abilities are raised to meet them\n- Template compatibility checks use precomputed creature groups, making verification and random generation much faster\n- Added challenge ratings 28 through 30",
